    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism teaching interpretation: serial overlapping dorsal plates with integrated large lateral spines and conservative low soft girdle. Two restrained blunt-tip sections hint at hollow spines; no microscopic bone/scute counts, complete soft anatomy, exact fossil measurement or locomotor mechanism claimed. Muted palette, nominal 0.075 m body length and limited rounding are art choices. Original inventory biomes remains an empty array, not a universal habitat statement.",
      "zh": "原创全体教学生活复原：连续叠覆背板、自然连接的大侧刺与保守低矮软质外套缘。两处克制钝端剖口提示刺内部空间，不主张微观骨片数、完整软组织、精确化石尺寸或运动机制。柔和配色、0.075米名义体长与圆润程度为美术设定。保留原始biomes空数组，不解释为通用生境。"
    },
